 are changing are indicators of the strength of the housing market andwhether homes are becoming more or less affordable. <strong>The median price of a home in the United States is currently $280,800</strong>.…\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"421e3141a285feeb\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.redfin.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1888722fc3e0c896\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nHousing Market & Prices Kansas 2023 - Home Value Estimator\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1888722fc3e0c896\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://realadvisor.com/housing-market-kansas/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8d27ee304f633c69\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAs of September 2022, Topeka home prices were up 7.1% compared to last year, selling for a median price of $150,000, with listing prices ranging from <strong>$10,000 to 3.7 million dollars</strong>.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8d27ee304f633c69\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"February 15, 2023\",\n      \"siteName\": \"realadvisor.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"43567a31dd511ee3\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nHousing Inventory: Median Listing Price in Kansas - FRED\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"43567a31dd511ee3\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/MEDLISPRIKS\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"bae18d8417e4fa05\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nDownload, graph, and track 840,000 economic time series from 119 sources.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"bae18d8417e4fa05\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"fred.stlouisfed.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"212d623773eb08c5\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nHousing Inventory: Median Listing Price per Square Feet in Kansas (MEDLISPRIPERSQUFEEKS) | FRED | St. Louis Fed\\n<<<END_